        <div class="kpi-sub">197 dividend events, 1977–2026</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- HIGHLIGHTS -->
    <div class="highlight-row">
      <div class="highlight-card">
        <h4>All-Time High</h4>
        <div class="big-num">$384.04</div>
        <p>Reached on December 11, 2025 — the peak of a multi-year bull run driven by strong earnings and consumer spending resilience.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="highlight-card gold-bg">
        <h4>Recent Price (Mar 11, 2026)</h4>
        <div class="big-num">$305.99</div>
        <p>20.3% below the all-time high, reflecting a broad market pullback in early 2026. Represents a 162.9% gain since the 2020 COVID trough.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="highlight-card warn">
        <h4>Worst Crisis Drawdown</h4>
        <div class="big-num">−83.9%</div>
        <p>2008–09 Financial Crisis: AXP collapsed from $49.30 (Jul 2007) to $7.93 (Mar 2009) as credit losses mounted in the global financial meltdown.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- TRAJECTORY SUMMARY -->
